s value schema, which Draft 2020-12 cannot express cross-field.","value_schema":{"type":"number"},"version":"v1"},{"id":"tax.us.2025.f1099div.1a.source-closure","identity_keys":[{"entity_kind":"kernel.family-horizon","kind":"entity","name":"family-horizon"},{"kind":"literal","name":"tax-year","values":["2025"]}],"nature":"determinable","schema":"fact-type.v2","supersession":{"policy":"free"},"title":"User-attested closure of the Form 1099-DIV box-1a source family for 2025, keyed on the family membership horizon current at attestation (ADR-0017): true asserts every furnished 1099-DIV box-1a statement item is recorded as of that horizon. This claim covers box 1a only - never box 1b, the recorded non-composable boxes, or Form 1040 line 3b (ADR-0016, ADR-0035 decision 2). A later membership transition displaces this closure through horizon succession; re-attestation on the successor horizon is required.","value_schema":{"type":"boolean"},"version":"v1"},{"id":"tax.us.2025.f1099div.1b.source-closure","identity_keys":[{"entity_kind":"kernel.family-horizon","kind":"entity","name":"family-horizon"},{"kind":"literal","name":"tax-year","values":["2025"]}],"nature":"determinable","schema":"fact-type.v2","supersession":{"policy":"free"},"title":"User-attested closure of the Form 1099-DIV box-1b source family for 2025, keyed on the family membership horizon current at attestation (ADR-0017): true asserts every furnished 1099-DIV box-1b statement item is recorded as of that horizon. This claim covers box 1b only - never box 1a, the recorded non-composable boxes, or Form 1040 line 3a (ADR-0016, ADR-0035 decision 2); the two per-box families close independently and their lines may block independently. A later membership transition displaces this closure through horizon succession; re-attestation on the successor horizon is required.","value_schema":{"type":"boolean"},"version":"v1"},{"id":"tax.us.2025.f1099div.recorded-boxes","identity_keys":[{"entity_kind":"tax.us.dividend-payer",